(52, 'Function', 'A Python function is a self-contained, reusable block of code that performs a specific task. It helps organize code, prevent repetition, and make programs easier to maintain and debug', '2026-03-16 04:00:00.000000', '', 1, '', 'A Python function is a self-contained, reusable block of code that performs a specific task. It helps organize code, prevent repetition, and make programs easier to maintain and debug', 'Ceramah, Diskusi Kelompok', '2026-03-15 14:40:43.014273', 3, 'Bagian 9'),
