round: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgb(233, 238, 246); border: 0px none rgb(68, 71, 70); inset: auto; clear: none; clip: auto; columns: auto; contain: none; container: none; content: normal; cursor: auto; cx: 0px; cy: 0px; d: none; direction: ltr; display: inline; fill: rgb(0, 0, 0); filter: none; flex: 0 1 auto; float: none; gap: normal; hyphens: manual; interactivity: auto; isolation: auto; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; marker: none; mask: none; offset: normal; opacity: 1; order: 0; outline: rgb(68, 71, 70) none 0px; overlay: none; padding: 1px 6px; page: auto; perspective: none; position: static; quotes: auto; r: 0px; resize: none; rotate: none; rx: auto; ry: auto; scale: none; speak: normal; stroke: none; transform: none; transition: all; translate: none; visibility: visible; x: 0px; y: 0px; zoom: 1; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; margin-top: 0px !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;\">IPKMahasiswa = 3.9</code></span></td><td style=\"animation: auto ease 0s 1 normal none running none; appearance: none; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); border: 1px solid; inset: auto; clear: none; clip: auto; columns: auto; contain: none; container: none; content: normal; cursor: auto; cx: 0px; cy: 0px; d: none; direction: ltr; fill: rgb(0, 0, 0); filter: none; flex: 0 1 auto; float: none; gap: normal; hyphens: manual; interactivity: auto; isolation: auto; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; marker: none; mask: none; offset: normal; opacity: 1; order: 0; outline: rgb(31, 31, 31) none 0px; overlay: none; padding: 8px 12px; page: auto; perspective: none; position: static; quotes: auto; r: 0px; resize: none; rotate: none; rx: auto; ry: auto; scale: none; speak: normal; stroke: none; transform: none; transition: all; translate: none; visibility: visible; x: 0px; y: 0px; zoom: 1; margin-top: 0px !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,0\" style=\"animation: auto ease 0s 1 normal none running none; appearance: none; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); border: 0px none rgb(31, 31, 31); inset: auto; clear: none; clip: auto; columns: auto; contain: none; container: none; content: normal; cursor: auto; cx: 0px; cy: 0px; d: none; direction: ltr; display: inline; fill: rgb(0, 0, 0); filter: none; flex: 0 1 auto; float: none; gap: normal; hyphens: manual; interactivity: auto; isolation: auto; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; marker: none; mask: none; offset: normal; opacity: 1; order: 0; outline: rgb(31, 31, 31) none 0px; overlay: none; padding: 0px; page: auto; perspective: none; position: static; quotes: auto; r: 0px; resize: none; rotate: none; rx: auto; ry: auto; scale: none; speak: normal; stroke: none; transform: none; transition: all; translate: none; visibility: visible; x: 0px; y: 0px; zoom: 1; margin-top: 0px !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;\"><code data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(68, 71, 70); animation: auto ease 0s 1 normal none running none; appearance: none; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgb(233, 238, 246); border: 0px none rgb(68, 71, 70); inset: auto; clear: none; clip: auto; columns: auto; contain: none; container: none; content: normal; cursor: auto; cx: 0px; cy: 0px; d: none; direction: ltr; display: inline; fill: rgb(0, 0, 0); filter: none; flex: 0 1 auto; float: none; gap: normal; hyphens: manual; interactivity: auto; isolation: auto; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; marker: none; mask: none; offset: normal; opacity: 1; order: 0; outline: rgb(68, 71, 70) none 0px; overlay: none; padding: 1px 6px; page: auto; perspective: none; position: static; quotes: auto; r: 0px; resize: none; rotate: none; rx: auto; ry: auto; scale: none; speak: normal; stroke: none; transform: none; transition: all; translate: none; visibility: visible; x: 0px; y: 0px; zoom: 1; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; margin-top: 0px !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;\">ipk_mahasiswa = 3.9</code></span></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 class=\"\">3. Perhatikan&nbsp;<i data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"14\">Case Sensitivity</i>&nbsp;(Huruf Besar-Kecil Berbeda)</h3><p>Python adalah bahasa yang case-sensitive. Artinya, huruf besar dan huruf kecil dianggap sebagai karakter yang sama sekali berbeda. Ini sering menjadi sumber error bagi pemula yang tidak konsisten saat mengetik.</p><pre class=\"\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">usia = 20<br>Usia = 30<br>USIA = 40<br>print(usia)&nbsp; # Output: 20<br># Ketiga variabel di atas dianggap berbeda oleh Python!</pre><h3 class=\"\">4.&nbsp;Jangan Awali dengan Angka</h3><p data-path-to-node=\"13\">Nama variabel boleh mengandung angka,&nbsp;<span data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"38\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">tapi tidak boleh diletakkan di depan</span>.</p><ul data-path-to-node=\"14\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"2\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Salah:</span>&nbsp;<code data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"9\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">1siswa</code>,&nbsp;<code data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"17\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">2orang</code>,&nbsp;<code data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"25\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">3dimensi</code>&nbsp;(Akan menyebabkan&nbsp;<i data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"52\">SyntaxError</i>)</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"2\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Benar:</span>&nbsp;<code data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"9\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">siswa1</code>,&nbsp;<code data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"17\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">orang_ke_2</code>,&nbsp;<code data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"29\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">dimensi_3</code></p></li></ul><h3 class=\"\">5.&nbsp;Hindari Kata Kunci Pesanan (Reserved Keywords)</h3><p data-path-to-node=\"13\">Python memiliki sekumpulan kata yang sudah \"dipesan\" untuk fungsi internal bahasanya. Anda dilarang keras menggunakan kata-kata ini sebagai nama variabel.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">Contoh kata terlarang: False, def, if, else, import, class, return, for, while, True</span></p><pre class=\"\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"># Salah (Akan Error karena \'class\' adalah keyword)<br>class = \"Bisnis Digital\"&nbsp;<br># Benar<br>nama_kelas = \"Bisnis Digital\"</pre><h4 class=\"\">6.&nbsp;Hindari Spasi dan Simbol Khusus</h4><p>Nama variabel tidak boleh mengandung spasi. Sebagai gantinya, gunakan underscore (_). Selain itu, hindari penggunaan simbol khusus seperti @, $, %, - (tanda minus), dll.</p><li><pre class=\"\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">? <span data-path-to-node=\"22,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"2\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Salah:</span> <code data-path-to-node=\"22,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"9\">harga barang</code>, <code data-path-to-node=\"22,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"23\">harga-barang</code>, <code data-path-to-node=\"22,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"37\">harga$<br></code>? <span data-path-to-node=\"22,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"2\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Benar:</span> <code data-path-to-node=\"22,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"9\">harga_barang</code></pre></li></div></div>', 111, 1, 3, '2026-01-20 03:44:35.647779', 4);
INSERT INTO `academy_coursematerial` (`id`, `title`, `material_type`, `video_url`, `file_attachment`, `text_content`, `duration_seconds`, `is_published`, `order`, `created_at`, `agenda_id`) VALUES
(11, 'Variabel Global dan Lokal', 'reading', '', '', '<p class=\"\"><img src=\"https://task.findstock.id/media/django-summernote/2026-01-20/1b68cc9c-bc24-46ca-bf00-4b553c1cad1c.png\" style=\"width: 626px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Variabel Global dan Lokal dalam Python</span></p><p>Dalam Python (dan banyak bahasa pemrograman lainnya), variabel dibagi menjadi variabel global dan variabel lokal berdasarkan di mana mereka dideklarasikan dan bagaimana mereka dapat diakses.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">1. Variabel Lokal</span></p><p>Variabel yang dideklarasikan di dalam fungsi dan hanya dapat digunakan di dalam fungsi tersebut.<span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">&nbsp;[<span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">A Local Variable is declared&nbsp;</span><span data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"29\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">inside</span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">&nbsp;a function or a specific block of code.]</span></span></p><p class=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Contoh Variabel Lokal</span></p><p><img src=\"https://task.findstock.id/media/django-summernote/2026-01-20/f47f9142-806e-4b21-a18b-a605311644c4.png\" style=\"width: 630px;\"></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><i>Penjelasan:</i></span></p><ul><li><code class=\"min-w-[1.625rem] max-w-full rounded bg-muted px-0.5 font-mono text-[0.875em] leading-none ring-1 ring-[var(--sp-color-border-control)]  whitespace-nowrap\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-slate-leaf=\"true\" data-offset-key=\"oWTGye00AQ7B:0\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">x</code><span data-offset-key=\"oWTGye00AQ7B:1\">&nbsp;hanya bisa diakses di dalam&nbsp;</span><code class=\"min-w-[1.625rem] max-w-full rounded bg-muted px-0.5 font-mono text-[0.875em] leading-none ring-1 ring-[var(--sp-color-border-control)]  whitespace-nowrap\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-slate-leaf=\"true\" data-offset-key=\"oWTGye00AQ7B:2\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">contoh_fungsi()</code><span data-offset-key=\"oWTGye00AQ7B:3\" data-slate-fragment=\"\">.</span></li><li><span data-offset-key=\"Xl2zbr0XRBxo:0\">Jika kita mencoba&nbsp;</span><code class=\"min-w-[1.625rem] max-w-full rounded bg-muted px-0.5 font-mono text-[0.875em] leading-none ring-1 ring-[var(--sp-color-border-control)]  whitespace-nowrap\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-slate-leaf=\"true\" data-offset-key=\"Xl2zbr0XRBxo:1\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">print(x)</code><span data-offset-key=\"Xl2zbr0XRBxo:2\">&nbsp;di luar fungsi, Python akan memberikan&nbsp;</span><span class=\"font-bold\" data-slate-leaf=\"true\" data-offset-key=\"Xl2zbr0XRBxo:3\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">error</span><span data-offset-key=\"Xl2zbr0XRBxo:4\">&nbsp;karena&nbsp;</span><code class=\"min-w-[1.625rem] max-w-full rounded bg-muted px-0.5 font-mono text-[0.875em] leading-none ring-1 ring-[var(--sp-color-border-control)]  whitespace-nowrap\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-slate-leaf=\"true\" data-offset-key=\"Xl2zbr0XRBxo:5\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">x</code><span data-offset-key=\"Xl2zbr0XRBxo:6\" data-slate-fragment=\"\">&nbsp;hanya ada di dalam fungsi tersebut.</span></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><span data-offset-key=\"Xl2zbr0XRBxo:6\" data-slate-fragment=\"\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"white-space: pre; font-size: 1rem;\">Variabel Global</span></span></p><p class=\"\">Variabel yang dideklarasikan di luar fungsi dan bisa diakses dari mana saja dalam program.<span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">&nbsp;[A Global Variable is declared outside of all functions, usually at the very top of your script or file.]</span></p><p><span data-slate-fragment=\"\" style=\"white-space: pre;\">Contoh Variabel Global</span></p><p><img src=\"https://task.findstock.id/media/django-summernote/2026-01-20/6f4ed54c-5894-403c-be6d-57da2b1e3df4.png\" style=\"width: 617px;\"><span data-slate-fragment=\"\" style=\"white-space: pre;\"><br></span></p><p><span data-slate-fragment=\"\" style=\"white-space: pre;\">Penjelasan: </span></p><ul><li><code class=\"min-w-[1.625rem] max-w-full rounded bg-muted px-0.5 font-mono text-[0.875em] leading-none ring-1 ring-[var(--sp-color-border-control)]  whitespace-nowrap\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-slate-leaf=\"true\" data-offset-key=\"JXXf82iPhjvs:0\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">y</code><span data-offset-key=\"JXXf82iPhjvs:1\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">&nbsp;dideklarasikan di luar fungsi, sehingga bisa diakses&nbsp;</span><span class=\"font-bold\" data-slate-leaf=\"true\" data-offset-key=\"JXXf82iPhjvs:2\" style=\"font-weight: bolder; font-size: 1rem;\">di dalam maupun di luar fungsi</span><span data-offset-key=\"JXXf82iPhjvs:3\" data-slate-fragment=\"\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">.</span></li></ul><p><span data-offset-key=\"JXXf82iPhjvs:3\" data-slate-fragment=\"\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">3. Mengubah Variabel Global di dalam Fungsi</span></span></p><p><span data-offset-key=\"JXXf82iPhjvs:3\" data-slate-fragment=\"\">Masalah: Jika kita mencoba mengubah variabel global di dalam fungsi tanpa deklarasi eksplisit, Python akan membuat variabel lokal baru.</span></p><p><span data-offset-key=\"JXXf82iPhjvs:3\" data-slate-fragment=\"\">Contoh Masalah:&nbsp;</span></p><p><img src=\"https://task.findstock.id/media/django-summernote/2026-01-20/bfbc21e2-5748-4aea-96c9-41cf9f569270.png\" style=\"width: 673px;\"><span data-offset-key=\"JXXf82iPhjvs:3\" data-slate-fragment=\"\"><br></span></p><p><span data-offset-key=\"JXXf82iPhjvs:3\" data-slate-fragment=\"\">Penjelasan:&nbsp;</span></p><ul><li><span data-offset-key=\"JXXf82iPhjvs:3\" data-slate-fragment=\"\"><span data-offset-key=\"ViHlYN8nPb9M:0\">Di dalam&nbsp;</span><code class=\"min-w-[1.625rem] max-w-full rounded bg-muted px-0.5 font-mono text-[0.875em] leading-none ring-1 ring-[var(--sp-color-border-control)]  whitespace-nowrap\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-slate-leaf=\"true\" data-offset-key=\"ViHlYN8nPb9M:1\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">ubah_z()</code><span data-offset-key=\"ViHlYN8nPb9M:2\">, Python mengira&nbsp;</span><code class=\"min-w-[1.625rem] max-w-full rounded bg-muted px-0.5 font-mono text-[0.875em] leading-none ring-1 ring-[var(--sp-color-border-control)]  whitespace-nowrap\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-slate-leaf=\"true\" data-offset-key=\"ViHlYN8nPb9M:3\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">z</code><span data-offset-key=\"ViHlYN8nPb9M:4\">&nbsp;adalah&nbsp;</span><span class=\"font-bold\" data-slate-leaf=\"true\" data-offset-key=\"ViHlYN8nPb9M:5\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">variabel lokal baru</span><span data-offset-key=\"ViHlYN8nPb9M:6\">, bukan variabel global&nbsp;</span><code class=\"min-w-[1.625rem] max-w-full rounded bg-muted px-0.5 font-mono text-[0.875em] leading-none ring-1 ring-[var(--sp-color-border-control)]  whitespace-nowrap\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-slate-leaf=\"true\" data-offset-key=\"ViHlYN8nPb9M:7\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">z</code><span data-offset-key=\"ViHlYN8nPb9M:8\" data-slate-fragment=\"\">.</span></span></li><li><span data-offset-key=\"JXXf82iPhjvs:3\" data-slate-fragment=\"\"><span data-offset-key=\"ViHlYN8nPb9M:8\" data-slate-fragment=\"\"><span data-offset-key=\"kr1CyEMPHpxZ:0\">Variabel global&nbsp;</span><code class=\"min-w-[1.625rem] max-w-full rounded bg-muted px-0.5 font-mono text-[0.875em] leading-none ring-1 ring-[var(--sp-color-border-control)]  whitespace-nowrap\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-slate-leaf=\"true\" data-offset-key=\"kr1CyEMPHpxZ:1\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">z</code><span data-offset-key=\"kr1CyEMPHpxZ:2\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"font-bold\" data-slate-leaf=\"true\" data-offset-key=\"kr1CyEMPHpxZ:3\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">tidak berubah</span><span data-offset-key=\"kr1CyEMPHpxZ:4\" data-slate-fragment=\"\">.</span></span></span></li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Contoh Lainnya:</b></p><p><b>1. Isi untuk Bagian \"Contoh Variabel Lokal\"</b></p><p>Gunakan analogi \"Uang di Dompet Pribadi\". Hanya pemilik dompet yang tahu isinya, orang luar tidak bisa mengambilnya.</p><pre class=\"\">def fungsi_dompet():<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; uang_di_dompet = 50000&nbsp; # &lt;-- Ini Variabel Lokal<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; print(f\"Di dalam fungsi: Saya punya uang Rp {uang_di_dompet}\")<br># Memanggil fungsi<br>fungsi_dompet()<br># Mencoba akses dari luar (Akan Error)<br># print(uang_di_dompet)&nbsp;<br># Error: name \'uang_di_dompet\' is not defined</pre><p><b>2. Isi untuk Bagian \"Contoh Variabel Global\"</b></p><p>Gunakan analogi \"Nama Universitas\". Semua mahasiswa (fungsi) di kampus tahu nama universitasnya tanpa perlu diberi tahu satu per satu.</p><pre class=\"\">nama_kampus = \"Universitas Negeri Makassar\" # &lt;-- Ini Variabel Global<br>def mahasiswa_satu():<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; print(f\"Saya kuliah di {nama_kampus}\")<br>def mahasiswa_dua():<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; print(f\"Teman saya juga kuliah di {nama_kampus}\")<br>mahasiswa_satu()<br>mahasiswa_dua()<br>print(f\"Kita semua ada di {nama_kampus}\")</pre><p><b>3.&nbsp; (Mengubah Variabel Global)</b></p><p><b>Contoh Masalah (Tanpa keyword Global):</b></p><pre class=\"\">saldo = 100000 # Global<br>def beli_pulsa():<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; saldo = 5000 # Python menganggap ini variabel BARU (Lokal)<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; print(f\"Saldo di dalam fungsi: {saldo}\")<br>beli_pulsa() # Output: 5000<br>print(f\"Saldo asli di luar: {saldo}\") # Output: TETAP 100000 (Tidak berubah)</pre><p>Solusi (Materi Tambahan untuk Modul): Anda perlu menambahkan kata kunci global jika ingin mengubah isinya secara permanen.</p><pre class=\"\">saldo = 100000 # Global<br>def beli_pulsa_beneran():<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; global saldo&nbsp; # &lt;-- Izin untuk mengubah variabel global<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; saldo = 5000&nbsp; # Sekarang ini mengubah variabel asli<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; print(f\"Saldo setelah beli pulsa: {saldo}\")<br>beli_pulsa_beneran()&nbsp;<br>print(f\"Saldo asli di luar sekarang: {saldo}\") # Output: 5000 (Berubah)</pre><p></p>', 111, 1, 4, '2026-01-20 05:55:05.871256', 4);
INSERT INTO `academy_coursematerial` (`id`, `title`, `material_type`, `video_url`, `file_attachment`, `text_content`, `duration_seconds`, `is_published`, `order`, `created_at`, `agenda_id`) VALUES
(12, 'Tipe Data', 'reading', '', '', '<p class=\"\">Tipe data adalah klasifikasi atau jenis data yang menentukan nilai apa yang bisa disimpan sebuah variabel, bagaimana data tersebut disimpan di memori, dan operasi apa yang bisa dilakukan padanya, seperti angka, teks (string), nilai benar/salah (boolean), atau daftar nilai (array). Ini adalah konsep fundamental dalam pemrograman komputer agar program dapat memahami dan memproses informasi secara tepat tanpa terjadi error.&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://task.findstock.id/media/django-summernote/2026-01-20/93d49592-770c-4a70-9284-98c745c11b29.png\" style=\"width: 1136px;\"></p><table data-path-to-node=\"3\" style=\"background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); animation: 0s ease 0s 1 normal none running none; appearance: none; border: 0px none rgb(31, 31, 31); inset: auto; clear: none; clip: auto; color: rgb(31, 31, 31); columns: auto; contain: none; container: none; content: normal; cursor: auto; cx: 0px; cy: 0px; d: none; direction: ltr; fill: rgb(0, 0, 0); filter: none; flex: 0 1 auto; float: none; gap: normal; hyphens: manual; interactivity: auto; isolation: auto; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 32px; margin-left: 0px; marker: none; mask: none; offset: normal; opacity: 1; order: 0; outline: rgb(31, 31, 31) none 0px; overlay: none; padding: 0px; page: auto; perspective: none; position: static; quotes: auto; r: 0px; resize: none; rotate: none; rx: auto; ry: auto; scale: none; speak: normal; stroke: none; transform: none; transition: all; translate: none; visibility: visible; x: 0px; y: 0px; zoom: 1; margin-top: 0px !important; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;\"><thead style=\"animation: 0s ease 0s 1 normal none running none; appearance: none; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); border: 0px none rgb(31, 31, 31); inset: auto; clear: none; clip: auto; columns: auto; co