-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; marker: none; mask: none; offset: normal; opacity: 1; order: 0; outline: rgb(31, 31, 31) none 0px; overlay: none; padding: 0px; page: auto; perspective: none; position: static; quotes: auto; r: 0px; resize: none; rotate: none; rx: auto; ry: auto; scale: none; speak: normal; stroke: none; transform: none; transition: all; translate: none; visibility: visible; x: 0px; y: 0px; zoom: 1; margin-top: 0px !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;\"><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(31, 31, 31); animation: 0s ease 0s 1 normal none running none; appearance: none; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); border: 0px none rgb(31, 31, 31); inset: auto; clear: none; clip: auto; columns: auto; contain: none; container: none; content: normal; cursor: auto; cx: 0px; cy: 0px; d: none; direction: ltr; fill: rgb(0, 0, 0); filter: none; flex: 0 1 auto; float: none; gap: normal; hyphens: manual; interactivity: auto; isolation: auto; marker: none; mask: none; offset: normal; opacity: 1; order: 0; outline: rgb(31, 31, 31) none 0px; overlay: none; padding: 0px; page: auto; perspective: none; position: static; quotes: auto; r: 0px; resize: none; rotate: none; rx: auto; ry: auto; scale: none; speak: normal; stroke: none; transform: none; transition: all; translate: none; visibility: visible; x: 0px; y: 0px; zoom: 1; font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;\">Berikut&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem;\">penjabaran lengkap tipe data Python dari tabel sebelumnya, disajikan dengan format&nbsp;</span><span data-path-to-node=\"0\" data-index-in-node=\"101\" style=\"font-weight: bolder; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem;\">Nilai</span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem;\">,&nbsp;</span><span data-path-to-node=\"0\" data-index-in-node=\"108\" style=\"font-weight: bolder; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem;\">Penjelasan</span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem;\">, dan&nbsp;</span><span data-path-to-node=\"0\" data-index-in-node=\"124\" style=\"font-weight: bolder; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem;\">Contoh Code</span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem;\">&nbsp;seperti..</span></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(31, 31, 31); animation: 0s ease 0s 1 normal none running none; appearance: none; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); border: 0px none rgb(31, 31, 31); inset: auto; clear: none; clip: auto; columns: auto; contain: none; container: none; content: normal; cursor: auto; cx: 0px; cy: 0px; d: none; direction: ltr; fill: rgb(0, 0, 0); filter: none; flex: 0 1 auto; float: none; gap: normal; hyphens: manual; interactivity: auto; isolation: auto; marker: none; mask: none; offset: normal; opacity: 1; order: 0; outline: rgb(31, 31, 31) none 0px; overlay: none; padding: 0px; page: auto; perspective: none; position: static; quotes: auto; r: 0px; resize: none; rotate: none; rx: auto; ry: auto; scale: none; speak: normal; stroke: none; transform: none; transition: all; translate: none; visibility: visible; x: 0px; y: 0px; zoom: 1; font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-left: 0px; animation: 0s ease 0s 1 normal none running none; appearance: none; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); border: 0px none rgb(31, 31, 31); inset: auto; clear: none; clip: auto; columns: auto; contain: none; container: none; content: normal; cursor: auto; cx: 0px; cy: 0px; d: none; direction: ltr; fill: rgb(0, 0, 0); filter: none; flex: 0 1 auto; float: none; gap: normal; hyphens: manual; interactivity: auto; isolation: auto; marker: none; mask: none; offset: normal; opacity: 1; order: 0; outline: rgb(31, 31, 31) none 0px; overlay: none; padding: 0px; page: auto; perspective: none; position: static; quotes: auto; r: 0px; resize: none; rotate: none; rx: auto; ry: auto; scale: none; speak: normal; stroke: none; transform: none; transition: all; translate: none; visibility: visible; x: 0px; y: 0px; zoom: 1; line-height: 1.15 !important;\"><font color=\"#1f1f1f\" face=\"Google Sans, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">1. String (str)</span></font></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-left: 0px; animation: 0s ease 0s 1 normal none running none; appearance: none; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); border: 0px none rgb(31, 31, 31); inset: auto; clear: none; clip: auto; columns: auto; contain: none; container: none; content: normal; cursor: auto; cx: 0px; cy: 0px; d: none; direction: ltr; fill: rgb(0, 0, 0); filter: none; flex: 0 1 auto; float: none; gap: normal; hyphens: manual; interactivity: auto; isolation: auto; marker: none; mask: none; offset: normal; opacity: 1; order: 0; outline: rgb(31, 31, 31) none 0px; overlay: none; padding: 0px; page: auto; perspective: none; position: static; quotes: auto; r: 0px; resize: none; rotate: none; rx: auto; ry: auto; scale: none; speak: normal; stroke: none; transform: none; transition: all; translate: none; visibility: visible; x: 0px; y: 0px; zoom: 1; line-height: 1.15 !important;\"><font color=\"#1f1f1f\" face=\"Google Sans, sans-serif\"><i>Value: \'Hello World\', \"Python 3\"</i></font></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-left: 0px; animation: 0s ease 0s 1 normal none running none; appearance: none; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); border: 0px none rgb(31, 31, 31); inset: auto; clear: none; clip: auto; columns: auto; contain: none; container: none; content: normal; cursor: auto; cx: 0px; cy: 0px; d: none; direction: ltr; fill: rgb(0, 0, 0); filter: none; flex: 0 1 auto; float: none; gap: normal; hyphens: manual; interactivity: auto; isolation: auto; marker: none; mask: none; offset: normal; opacity: 1; order: 0; outline: rgb(31, 31, 31) none 0px; overlay: none; padding: 0px; page: auto; perspective: none; position: static; quotes: auto; r: 0px; resize: none; rotate: none; rx: auto; ry: auto; scale: none; speak: normal; stroke: none; transform: none; transition: all; translate: none; visibility: visible; x: 0px; y: 0px; zoom: 1; line-height: 1.15 !important;\"><font color=\"#1f1f1f\" face=\"Google Sans, sans-serif\">A data type used to store text or characters. It is Immutable (the content cannot be changed character by character once created).</font></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-left: 0px; animation: 0s ease 0s 1 normal none running none; appearance: none; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); border: 0px none rgb(31, 31, 31); inset: auto; clear: none; clip: auto; columns: auto; contain: none; container: none; content: normal; cursor: auto; cx: 0px; cy: 0px; d: none; direction: ltr; fill: rgb(0, 0, 0); filter: none; flex: 0 1 auto; float: none; gap: normal; hyphens: manual; interactivity: auto; isolation: auto; marker: none; mask: none; offset: normal; opacity: 1; order: 0; outline: rgb(31, 31, 31) none 0px; overlay: none; padding: 0px; page: auto; perspective: none; position: static; quotes: auto; r: 0px; resize: none; rotate: none; rx: auto; ry: auto; scale: none; speak: normal; stroke: none; transform: none; transition: all; translate: none; visibility: visible; x: 0px; y: 0px; zoom: 1; line-height: 1.15 !important;\"><font color=\"#1f1f1f\" face=\"Google Sans, sans-serif\"><br></font></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-left: 0px; animation: 0s ease 0s 1 normal none running none; appearance: none; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); border: 0px none rgb(31, 31, 31); inset: auto; clear: none; clip: auto; columns: auto; contain: none; container: none; content: normal; cursor: auto; cx: 0px; cy: 0px; d: none; direction: ltr; fill: rgb(0, 0, 0); filter: none; flex: 0 1 auto; float: none; gap: normal; hyphens: manual; interactivity: auto; isolation: auto; marker: none; mask: none; offset: normal; opacity: 1; order: 0; outline: rgb(31, 31, 31) none 0px; overlay: none; padding: 0px; page: auto; perspective: none; position: static; quotes: auto; r: 0px; resize: none; rotate: none; rx: auto; ry: auto; scale: none; speak: normal; stroke: none; transform: none; transition: all; translate: none; visibility: visible; x: 0px; y: 0px; zoom: 1; line-height: 1.15 !important;\"></p></div><p><iframe src=\"https://trinket.io/embed/python3/b1707f6484fa\" width=\"100%\" height=\"356\" frameborder=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\" marginheight=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">2. Integer (int)</span></p><p><i>Value: 100, -50, 2024</i></p><p>Explanation: A whole number data type (without decimals), can be positive or negative. It is Immutable.</p><p><iframe src=\"https://trinket.io/embed/python/266d0a72bfb2\" width=\"100%\" height=\"600\" frameborder=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\" marginheight=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">3. Float (float)</span></p><p><i>Value: 3.14, 0.005, -2.5</i></p><p></p><p>A decimal number data type (floating point). Used for precise calculations. It is Immutable.</p><p><iframe src=\"https://trinket.io/embed/python/1ed17e317d4b\" width=\"100%\" height=\"600\" frameborder=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\" marginheight=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">4. List (list)</span></p><p><i>Value: [\'aba\', 786, 2.23]</i></p><p>A data type that can store various types of data in an ordered sequence. It is&nbsp;<span data-path-to-node=\"22\" data-index-in-node=\"92\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Mutable</span>&nbsp;(items can be modified, added, or removed).</p><p><iframe src=\"https://trinket.io/embed/python/ece82b9119a8\" width=\"100%\" height=\"600\" frameborder=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\" marginheight=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">5. Tuple (tuple)</span></p><p><i>Value: (\'abcd\', 786, 2.23)</i></p><p>Similar to a List (stores ordered data), but it is Immutable (the data inside is permanent and cannot be changed or added to after creation). More memory efficient than a List.</p><p><img src=\"https://task.findstock.id/media/django-summernote/2026-01-20/58957a1f-3f49-4874-84ac-dc4dc4412e03.png\" style=\"width: 856px;\"></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">6. Dictionary (dict)</span></p><p><i>Value: {\'name\': \'John\', \'code\': 101}</i></p><p>A data type that stores Key : Value pairs. It is very fast for looking up data based on keys. It is Mutable.</p><p><iframe src=\"https://trinket.io/embed/python/f9094831dab8\" width=\"100%\" height=\"600\" frameborder=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\" marginheight=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">7. Set (set)</span></p><p><i>Value: {1, 2, 3, \'abc\'}</i></p><p>A collection of&nbsp;<span data-path-to-node=\"40\" data-index-in-node=\"29\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">unique</span>&nbsp;data (no duplicates allowed) and&nbsp;<span data-path-to-node=\"40\" data-index-in-node=\"69\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">unordered</span>&nbsp;(no index like 0, 1, etc.). It is&nbsp;<span data-path-to-node=\"40\" data-index-in-node=\"113\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Mutable</span>.</p><p><img src=\"https://task.findstock.id/media/django-summernote/2026-01-20/37566a89-e7a1-4946-9591-c67e0297754b.png\" style=\"width: 1151.2px;\"><i><br></i></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">8. Boolean (bool)</span></p><p><i>Value: True, False</i></p><p>A logical data type that has only two possible values: True or False. Often used in conditional statements (if/else). It is Immutable<i>.</i></p><p><img src=\"https://task.findstock.id/media/django-summernote/2026-01-20/e060fe95-be7d-4bcf-a34d-9d5ef8e6b7f7.png\" style=\"width: 1151.2px;\"></p>', 0, 1, 8, '2026-01-26 02:34:16.706056', 14);
INSERT INTO `academy_coursematerial` (`id`, `title`, `material_type`, `video_url`, `file_attachment`, `text_content`, `duration_seconds`, `is_published`, `order`, `created_at`, `agenda_id`) VALUES
(43, 'Operator', 'reading', '', '', '<p></p><p></p><h3 class=\"\"><font color=\"#6badde\">1. Pengantar: Apa itu Operator?</font></h3><p>Untuk menjalankan operasi di Python membutuhkan operator dan operan. Operator di dalam Python adalah simbol khusus yang berfungsi untuk menjalankan suatu operasi tertentu, baik operasi aritmatika maupun operasi logika. Sedangkan nilai yang dioperasikan oleh operator dinamakan sebagai operan.</p><p>Contoh sederhana: 5+3</p><ul><li>5 dan 3 adalah <b>Operand</b>.</li><li>+ adalah <b>Operator</b>.</li></ul><h3 class=\"\"><font color=\"#3984c6\">2. Jenis-Jenis Operator</font></h3><p>Python membagi operator menjadi beberapa kategori utama yang wajib dipahami.</p><h4 class=\"\">A. Operator Aritmatika (Arithmetic Operators).&nbsp;</h4><p>Digunakan untuk melakukan perhitungan matematika dasar.</p><table data-path-to-node=\"14\" style=\"animation: auto ease 0s 1 normal none running none; appearance: none; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); border: 0px none rgb(31, 31, 31); inset: auto; clear: none; clip: auto; color: rgb(31, 31, 31); columns: auto; contain: none; container: none; content: normal; cursor: auto; cx: 0px; cy: 0px; d: none; direction: ltr; fill: rgb(0, 0, 0); filter: none; flex: 0 1 auto; float: none; gap: normal; hyphens: manual; interactivity: auto; isolation: auto; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 32px; margin-left: 0px; marker: none; mask: none; offset: normal; opacity: 1; order: 0; outline: rgb(31, 31, 31) none 0px; overlay: none; padding: 0px; page: auto; perspective: none; position: static; quotes: auto; r: 0px; resize: none; rotate: none; rx: auto; ry: auto; scale: none; speak: normal; stroke: none; transform: none; transition: all; translate: none; visibility: visible; x: 0px; y: 0px; zoom: 1; margin-top: 0px !important; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;\"><thead style=\"animation: auto ease 0s 1 normal none r